B.aP5=new A.mb("What Nombara is","Nombara is a booking and queue platform for local dispensaries. It shows live queue numbers and lets you get a token online instead of waiting in person. Nombara is not a medical provider: it doesn't give medical advice, diagnoses, or interpret prescriptions \u2014 that stays entirely between you and the doctor.")
B.aPb=new A.mb("What we collect, and why","Account: your phone number, used only to sign you in.\n\nPatient profiles: name, age, and relationship (self, mother, father\u2026) for each person you book tokens for \u2014 this is what's shown to the doctor and reception when your token comes up.\n\nBooking activity: which doctor, dispensary, and time slot you booked, and your token's status (waiting, channeled, absent, cancelled) \u2014 this is how the live queue and billing work.\n\nWe collect only what's needed to run the queue. We don't ask for your address, payment card details, or medical history.")
B.aP9=new A.mb("National ID (NIC)","Nombara doesn't currently ask for your NIC. If a future version adds it as an optional field, it is stored encrypted and can only be read back by a server-side function that checks it belongs to your account \u2014 never as plain text, and never visible to dispensary staff.")
B.aP7=new A.mb("Payments, cancellations & refunds","Nombara never takes a card payment from a patient. The booking fee and the doctor's fee are both paid in cash at the dispensary counter, after you're seen. Because no online payment is ever taken, there is nothing to refund: if you cancel, don't attend, or a session is cancelled by the doctor, you simply aren't charged \u2014 a token is only billed once the doctor marks it \"Done\".")
B.aPa=new A.mb("Who can see your data","The dispensary's reception and the doctor you booked can see a token's name, age, and queue status while it's active \u2014 the same information they'd note down on a paper token in person. We don't sell, rent, or share your data with advertisers or any other third party.")
B.aP4=new A.mb("How your data is protected","Data is encrypted in transit (HTTPS) and at rest. Fields that identify you outside the app \u2014 like a national ID, if you're ever asked for one \u2014 are additionally encrypted at the database column level and only decryptable through a check that it's your own account asking.")
B.aP6=new A.mb("Your choices","You can edit or remove a patient profile at any time from the Profiles tab. To delete your account, open the menu and choose \"Delete my account\" \u2014 this removes your sign-in and clears the identifying details on your patient profiles and past bookings. Booking records themselves stay on a dispensary's ledger without your name attached, since dispensaries are required to keep billing history. If a Doctor or Dispensary Owner account is linked to the same phone number, contact us using the details below instead, so deleting your patient data doesn't affect that business account.")
B.aP8=new A.mb("Contact","Questions about this policy or your data: hello@nombara.app")
B.aII=s([B.aP5,B.aPb,B.aP9,B.aP7,B.aPa,B.aP4,B.aP6,B.aP8],A.az("A<mb>"))
